1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,160
What makes a great

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:04,140
employee stand out?

3
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:06,840
I am Dr. Hyma Prasad,

4
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:08,760
a Psychologist.

5
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:12,060
How should an employee

6
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,560
conduct themselves

7
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,920
in their workplace?

8
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:19,320
Communication must be clear.

9
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:22,840
Speak properly with everyone.

10
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:25,560
Be grateful

11
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:27,520
for your job.

12
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,840
Many people desperately

13
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:31,960
want a job,

14
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,020
yet complain once hired.

15
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:36,420
Discontent is common today.

16
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:39,840
Instead, thank God

17
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,120
for this opportunity.

18
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:44,520
Treat work as worship

19
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:46,540
and show gratitude.

20
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:48,900
Dedication is essential.

21
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:52,880
Do your work without delays.

22
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:56,660
Demonstrate your true potential

23
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:59,880
and prove your capability.

24
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:02,740
Keep learning new skills

25
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:05,500
and practice patience.

26
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:08,640
Mentors may get annoyed,

27
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:11,020
people have moods.

28
00:01:11,020 --> 00:01:13,120
Stay calm around them,

29
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:15,720
absorb the knowledge,

30
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:17,920
and develop your skills.

31
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:21,360
When you upskill yourself,

32
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:24,880
job passion naturally rises.

33
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:27,720
Whatever your job role,

34
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:30,620
nurturing these habits

35
00:01:30,620 --> 00:01:33,360
sparks genuine love for work.

36
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:36,060
Love what you do,

37
00:01:36,060 --> 00:01:39,220
embrace every challenge,

38
00:01:39,220 --> 00:01:41,900
and you will easily

39
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:44,900
reach your dream position.

